      "height": 0,
      "right": 112,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 4,
      "str": "Recurrent neural networks, long short-term memory [13] and gated recurrent [7] neural networks",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 685.35,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 504,
      "visualLineId": 1,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 5,
      "str": "in particular, have been firmly established as state of the art approaches in sequence modeling and",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 674.45,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 504,
      "visualLineId": 2,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 6,
      "str": "transduction problems such as language modeling and machine translation [35, 2, 5]. Numerous",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 663.54,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 504,
      "visualLineId": 3,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 7,
      "str": "efforts have since continued to push the boundaries of recurrent language models and encoder-decoder",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 652.63,
      "width": 396.17,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 504.17,
      "visualLineId": 4,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 8,
      "str": "architectures [38, 24, 15].",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 641.72,
      "width": 102.37,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 210.37,
      "visualLineId": 5,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 9,
      "str": "Recurrent models typically factor computation along the symbol positions of the input and output",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 625.33,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 504,
      "visualLineId": 6,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 10,
      "str": "sequences. Aligning the positions to steps in computation time, they generate a sequence of hidden",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 614.42,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 9.96,
      "right": 504,
      "visualLineId": 7,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 11,
      "str": "states",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 603.51,
      "width": 21.92,
      "height": 9.96,
